The request path is built in `src/club-transfers.ts` by `clubTransfersPath`, which returns `clubs/${clubId}/transfers?...`. The `ClubTransfers` component in `src/ClubTransfers.tsx` fetches it with `useResource(clubTransfersPath(clubId, filter))`.

On the server, `server/app.ts` registers `app.get("/api/clubs/:id/transfers", ...)`. The handler calls `clubTransfers(store, id, request.query)`, which is defined in `server/club-transfers.ts` and produces the response. I read these call sites directly and did not run the code.

